{
  "scenario_id": "ahu1_high_static_safety_bypass",
  "title": "AHU-1 High-Static Safety Bypass and Duct Failure",
  "description": "A deliberately miscommissioned high-static safety and failed-low duct-pressure signal allow the supply fan to drive against closed VAV dampers. This is a training-only demonstration of why an independent, manual-reset high-static switch must stop the fan before the duct pressure class is exceeded.",
